title Utility Operator Management Business Process

== Utility Operator CRUD ==

Camunda->Kong: CRUD Request (Utility Operator)
Kong->Utility Service: Forward CRUD Request
activate Utility Service
Utility Service->Database: Read/Write UtilityOperator data
Database-->Utility Service: Result
Utility Service-->Kong: Response
deactivate Utility Service
Kong-->Camunda: Forward Response

== Grid Zone Management ==

Camunda->Kong: CRUD Request (Grid Zone)
Kong->Utility Service: Forward CRUD Request
activate Utility Service

note right of Utility Service: Grid Zone operations:\n- Create zone under a UtilityOperator\n- Update maxCapacity\n- Set geographic boundaries

Utility Service->Database: Read/Write GridZone data\n(gridZoneId, utilityOperatorId,\nmaxCapacity, boundaries)
Database-->Utility Service: Result
Utility Service-->Kong: Response
deactivate Utility Service
Kong-->Camunda: Forward Response
